//! The gallery harness (ui doc §11.2): a mini-launch loads `Modules/Common.lua`,
//! `Data/Global.lua` and `Modules/Main.lua` (methods only), then runs `lua/gallery/<name>.lua`;
//! the Rust counterpart `src/gallery/<name>.rs` builds the same controls through pob-ui-core.
//! Owner: U8. The module list is generated by build.rs from `src/gallery/*.rs`.

include!(concat!(env!("OUT_DIR"), "/galleries.rs"));
